# This file is no longer needed.
#
# The app used to require a Google OAuth client + a Google Sheets service
# account here (for Google sign-in). Login has since been switched to a
# simple built-in username/password system (see user_store.py) that needs
# no secrets at all -- accounts and passwords are stored locally in
# data/users.json instead.
#
# You can safely delete this file and the .streamlit/ folder (if nothing
# else is in it) -- kept here only as a pointer in case you're wondering
# where your old Google setup notes went. If you have a real
# .streamlit/secrets.toml file with your old Google credentials in it,
# that one is safe to delete too -- nothing in the app reads it anymore.
